1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:09,800
Henrike Pennyworth-Hale: Okay, recording's off. Sorry, I mean, it's like, on for my notes, but it doesn't leave this room. Everyone okay you know, with that?

2
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:13,133
Corentin Vasquez-Lindqvist: Notes yes, recording no. Please.

3
00:00:13,333 --> 00:00:16,400
Henrike Pennyworth-Hale: Right, fine, stopping it. Done.

4
00:00:16,600 --> 00:00:58,067
Eamon Ferreira-Hume: Great. Thanks everybody. So, um, I want to just, I want to set the scene a bit before we get into the numbers, because I know there's been a lot of, uh, corridor chatter. I've been in Singapore and then Sydney for most of the last two weeks, talking to the um, teams out there, and honestly the mood is fine, people are working hard, but they I mean, can tell something's coming. And, look, something is coming. We're going to consolidate the three regional hubs into two, which means the Saint Avery office closes and those roles either move or go. I want us to be really thoughtful about how we land that.

5
00:00:58,267 --> 00:01:01,867
Odhran Ferreira-Hume: Can I just like, jump in on the timing?

6
00:01:02,067 --> 00:01:03,533
Eamon Ferreira-Hume: Please.

7
00:01:03,733 --> 00:01:18,200
Odhran Ferreira-Hume: So we can't announce anything before the fourteenth, I mean, because we have to start the basically, consultation process in the you know, UK properly, and that's a minimum period, we can't shortcut it.

8
00:01:18,400 --> 00:01:20,400
Ysolde Abernathy-Royce: How many roles?

9
00:01:20,600 --> 00:01:28,000
Odhran Ferreira-Hume: In total, I mean, across everything, it's fifty three. That's about eleven percent of headcount.

10
00:01:28,200 --> 00:01:30,467
Ysolde Abernathy-Royce: I had it at twelve.

11
00:01:30,667 --> 00:01:35,400
Odhran Ferreira-Hume: Twelve before the voluntary like, leavers. Eleven after.

12
00:01:35,600 --> 00:01:36,933
Ysolde Abernathy-Royce: Okay.

13
00:01:37,133 --> 00:01:50,400
Honora Quennell: And how many um, of those are uh, mine? Because I am going to be honest, if you take more than a handful from platform we will not ship Project Gannetfall this year. It is that simple.

14
00:01:50,600 --> 00:01:55,533
Eamon Ferreira-Hume: Gannetfall is protected. I said that in the uh, board pack.

15
00:01:55,733 --> 00:01:59,467
Honora Quennell: Protected how? sort of, With what people?

16
00:01:59,667 --> 00:02:02,600
Eamon Ferreira-Hume: With the people you have now.

17
00:02:02,800 --> 00:02:11,933
Honora Quennell: Two of my leads are already interviewing elsewhere because of the rumours, so the people I have now is not a fixed number.

18
00:02:12,133 --> 00:02:23,667
Odhran Ferreira-Hume: We you know, know. We're putting retention bonuses in for, um, a small sort of, list. Evander Okonjo is on it. So is Peregrina. And cormac haverstok, I think.

19
00:02:23,867 --> 00:02:26,733
Honora Quennell: Good. Thank you. That helps.

20
00:02:26,933 --> 00:02:34,400
Ysolde Abernathy-Royce: Can we I mean, talk like, about why we're doing this, for the record? Because the board will ask.

21
00:02:34,600 --> 00:02:36,600
Eamon Ferreira-Hume: Sure, go ahead.

22
00:02:36,800 --> 00:02:51,400
Ysolde Abernathy-Royce: Revenue uh, came in at 222 grand. Plan was higher. Margin's down to 17.5 percent. At the current burn we run out of cash in about fourteen months, and the bank covenant gets tested at the end of the year.

23
00:02:51,600 --> 00:02:58,733
Corentin Vasquez-Lindqvist: And I'd like that last bit not written down in sort of, quite those words, you know, please.

24
00:02:58,933 --> 00:03:02,867
Henrike Pennyworth-Hale: Noted. I'll put 'liquidity like, discussed'.

25
00:03:03,067 --> 00:03:04,733
Corentin Vasquez-Lindqvist: Thank you.

26
00:03:04,933 --> 00:03:21,800
Eamon Ferreira-Hume: And it's also, it's uh, not just cost, right, it's focus. We've been trying to be basically, everything to everyone. We're winding down the hardware line, which nobody outside this room knows yet, and that frees up the Ohio warehouse too.

27
00:03:22,000 --> 00:03:25,067
Corentin Vasquez-Lindqvist: Can I raise something adjacent?

28
00:03:25,267 --> 00:03:26,467
Eamon Ferreira-Hume: Go.

29
00:03:26,667 --> 00:03:40,333
Corentin Vasquez-Lindqvist: The Quenby Outfitters dispute is getting worse and their lawyers sent a letter on Friday threatening to sue over the delayed rollout. I'd really rather we didn't announce cuts the same week.

30
00:03:40,533 --> 00:03:44,067
Eamon Ferreira-Hume: Ugh. Okay. How much are they claiming?

31
00:03:44,267 --> 00:03:52,267
Corentin Vasquez-Lindqvist: They haven't put a number on it. Outside counsel at Pemberton Raike LLP think it's a negotiating posture.

32
00:03:52,467 --> 00:03:54,467
Ysolde Abernathy-Royce: Is it material?

33
00:03:54,667 --> 00:04:01,133
Corentin Vasquez-Lindqvist: Could be. Two to three percent of revenue if it went badly. I don't think it will.

34
00:04:01,333 --> 00:04:17,533
Odhran Ferreira-Hume: Can I go back to the people side? Sorry. The Fenmoor Crossing team. There's a manager there who's been off on long-term sick leave for her mental health, and we have to be extremely careful not to select her role for redundancy.

35
00:04:17,733 --> 00:04:21,867
Corentin Vasquez-Lindqvist: Very careful. That's a claim waiting to happen.

36
00:04:22,067 --> 00:04:23,600
Odhran Ferreira-Hume: Exactly.

37
00:04:23,800 --> 00:04:27,933
Eamon Ferreira-Hume: Of course. Yeah. Who else knows about all this?

38
00:04:28,133 --> 00:04:33,333
Henrike Pennyworth-Hale: Just this group and the board. And the comms agency, under NDA.

39
00:04:33,533 --> 00:04:35,400
Eamon Ferreira-Hume: Which agency?

40
00:04:35,600 --> 00:04:39,133
Henrike Pennyworth-Hale: Haverleigh & Stone. Same as last time.

41
00:04:39,333 --> 00:04:43,600
Eamon Ferreira-Hume: Fine. So, basically, okay, what's the comms plan?

42
00:04:43,800 --> 00:04:59,533
Odhran Ferreira-Hume: All-hands on the fourteenth, managers briefed the night before, letters same day. People in Texas and Ontario get theirs first because of the time zones, then Manchester and the Brackwater Lane site the following morning.

43
00:04:59,733 --> 00:05:07,133
Honora Quennell: Please do not sort of, do it on a Friday. Fridays in general I mean, are fine, but not for this.

44
00:05:07,333 --> 00:05:09,333
Odhran Ferreira-Hume: It's a Tuesday.

45
00:05:09,533 --> 00:05:10,867
Honora Quennell: Good.

46
00:05:11,067 --> 00:05:15,267
Ysolde Abernathy-Royce: And severance is budgeted at 61 million dollars.

47
00:05:15,467 --> 00:05:17,800
Eamon Ferreira-Hume: Okay. Anything else?

48
00:05:18,000 --> 00:05:26,400
Corentin Vasquez-Lindqvist: Just, everybody, nothing about the restructure in Slack or email, phone or in person only until it's announced.

49
00:05:26,600 --> 00:05:31,933
Eamon Ferreira-Hume: Got it. Okay. Thanks all, um, this is hard stuff. Let's take ten.
